+/*
+ * SVGASignedRect --
+ * SVGASignedPoint --
+ *
+ *    Signed rectangle and point primitives. These are used by the new
+ *    2D primitives for drawing to Screen Objects, which can occupy a
+ *    signed virtual coordinate space.
